2026-10-31T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2360) 'the stages, the one beta, and the nongoals.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2360) 'Which use cases does the campus beta ship?
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2360) 'A feature that misses the one beta keeps its RFD and its state.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2360) 'Check a new idea against the non-goals in the details, and cut the beta when the gate of RFD66606-2436 passes with its control.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The campus ships one beta
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The beta ships one platform and the use cases that ride on it (operator, 2026-11-25). The details hold the rest.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2360) '- See each other, RFD66606-2436, cuts the beta: one person on the win64 desktop and one on a second win64 desktop each see the other's avatar (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2360) '- Voice, the model console and the planning persona ride on it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2360) '- A server is a NixOS flake container under Ankaios (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2360) '- A character moves by walk mode.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

