 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2360) '- RFD66606-2447, beta 1, folded in here (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The platform
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The platform is one guest host, one message shape and one build path. A use case is in the beta when it is a guest of that platform with a gate and a control, and it adds no host, message shape or build path of its own. The use cases maximize what the platform serves and the work minimizes what each costs (operator, 2026-11-25). The use cases named are seeing each other (RFD66606-2436), voice between the players, the console that loads, unloads and chains local models, and the persona that answers from a planning domain (RFD66606-2339), with the planner and the solver as its guests (operator, 2026-11-25). The beta ships each use case whose own gate has passed with its control by the cut; a use case whose gate has not passed does not hold the cut. A use case is a guest of the platform with a gate and a control, and adds none of its own. An RFD outside this list keeps its state (RFD66606-1000).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The beta ships one native build, win64 on Windows. The Steam Frame and the Steam Deck are rescinded as targets (operator, 2026-11-26). The board-wide non-goals of RFD66606-2490 bind the beta too.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2360) 'Servers and protocols
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2360) 'Anything that is a protocol or a server has an AsyncAPI 3.1 document, written before or with it (operator, 2026-11-25). A server is a gen_server. Its document may carry its states as data in `x-state-machine`: an initial state, the states, and transitions that name messages of the document. The server refuses a message with no transition from its state, and a document without the block describes a plain gen_server (operator, 2026-11-25).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The zone server, the stores and the secrets engine are each a NixOS flake that builds a container image, run by Podman under Eclipse Ankaios as a workload whose manifest pins the image by digest (RFD66606-2501). The win64 client ships as folders pushed with ORAS and pulled by digest. No server piece ships as win64 or runs under NSSM (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2360) 'Walk mode
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The character walks by walk mode: the motion guest drives it from clips in an AnimationLibrary (RFD66606-2487), first proved on the plaza walk of RFD66606-2408. No hand-written character controller is added (RFD66606-2363) (operator, 2026-11-11). It is proved on the plaza walk of RFD66606-2408.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2360) 'Non-goals
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2360) 'Everything outside the beta is cut from this list, and an RFD outside it keeps its state (RFD66606-1000). A new idea that matches a nongoal is refused, and the list is not argued again before the beta ships. The non-goals named so far:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

